abstract: >-
  A Python CLI package for the pairwise registration of
  multiscale, multimodal, and multichannel images. It
  leverages itk-elastix to provide rigid, affine, and
  B‑spline registration schemes, and also offers automatic
  alignment via keypoint-based search.
